      {
        "id": "OrnnR",
        "name": "Call of the Forge God",
        "description": "Ornn summons a massive elemental at a location which travels toward him with increasing speed. Enemies run over by the elemental take damage, are slowed and are made Brittle. Ornn can recast the ability to charge into the elemental, redirecting it in the direction he hits it, causing the elemental to affect any enemies it runs over to be knocked up, dealing the same damage and re-applying Brittle.",
        "tooltip": "Ornn summons a massive lava elemental, which stampedes towards him, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(125/175/225 + (20% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>, applying <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Brittle</span> to, and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> enemies hit by 40/50/60% for 3 seconds.<br /><br />Ornn can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> to dash with a headbutt. If he dashes into the elemental, he redirects and empowers it, causing it to <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knock Up</span> the first champion for 1 second and subsequent champions for 0.5 seconds. The elemental also deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(125/175/225 + (20% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and reapplies <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Brittle</span>.",
